{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go, stop\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"bad!event\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml013-comma-separated-events.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml013-comma-separated-events.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":8,"byteOffset":114,"endColumn":32,"endLine":3,"startColumn":24,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"go stop"}}]}],"description":{"text":"replace commas with spaces"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml013-comma-separated-events.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":32,"endLine":3,"startColumn":24,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"event descriptors are whitespace-separated, not comma-separated\n\n**Note:** `event` is a whitespace-separated list of descriptors (`a`, `a.b`, `a.*`, `*`); commas and other punctuation never match\n\n**Help:** replace commas with spaces; each descriptor is matched independently\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.12.1 Event Descriptors","text":"event descriptors are whitespace-separated, not comma-separated"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":122,"start":114},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML013"},{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml013-comma-separated-events.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":33,"endLine":4,"startColumn":24,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"event descriptor `bad!event` contains an invalid character\n\n**Note:** `event` is a whitespace-separated list of descriptors (`a`, `a.b`, `a.*`, `*`); commas and other punctuation never match\n\n**Help:** use XML name-style event descriptors containing letters, digits, `_`, `-`, `:`, and `.`; `*` and `.*` are wildcard descriptors\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.12.1 Event Descriptors","text":"event descriptor `bad!event` contains an invalid character"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":169,"start":160},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML013"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`event` is a whitespace-separated list of descriptors (`a`, `a.b`, `a.*`, `*`); commas and other punctuation never match"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: separate descriptors with spaces and use only name characters, `.`, and the `*` wildcard.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.12.1 Event Descriptors\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML013` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#EventDescriptors","id":"SCXML013","name":"SCXML013","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a transition `event` is not a valid event-descriptor list"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}